E", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393272_528042999853730_2354717409969290768_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y1KAaDUf338Q7kNvwEn52Tg&_nc_oc=AdmVioZpBAk3pY9XJdEkIQvpW0IGxuaGOD_l0TvW0SwjYYeOBfdNAzIsRS22xpsDuy4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftvtHjhKUSw-IctddHhN1SahHrE07AdFmPd2xWMaAPvPw&oe=69A58536"}]}, "id": "1201716164854208", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "ScreenShot09.png", "id": "1847710892750149", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391959_1847710896083482_8455521519849642166_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4mXkdR9cjnEQ7kNvwEUPET4&_nc_oc=AdmbdqijWgjuXP-2RGo6sv6tmRVwdKD3YLXZgYSfqbXwK1FZAZT79thGxJXO6s_zHu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfubvVZaHQIS6WXn9MXhq187FEoC2z7PSuxiTr-ftvMlmw&oe=69A58B37"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot07.png", "id": "558446980581371", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393328_558446983914704_7041934379838428535_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7UH58X50K3QQ7kNvwHzNazy&_nc_oc=Adn1penjG_pbjNGqsvva-xqJc6utdgiqTwV9lL7IKFn43R3S-4i5sYjQxjpwaRfiSq4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvlvE27fyfOSS_uD9P7UQ6OrunTOyJCd-vJHumg_63HzQ&oe=69A5854A"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot05.png", "id": "643700711594610", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393887_643700714927943_2314168505514143083_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OCKa3um52xUQ7kNvwFc6jqc&_nc_oc=Adm-bGmImfiTerhYgeoQ9cSNm2lOVg0DSFPqP7HXIzldBIhZs4AVQCyeHrJM_4OX6Bk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv2oKztb8L5gL060z5MC6jqYxVxy-0i5aelmh-P73ggAA&oe=69A58162"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot06.png", "id": "1284290416010883", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391982_1284290419344216_9045095641995815940_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_QheNi9tWLsQ7kNvwHnHFHy&_nc_oc=AdmEPHrtf1EwvFLfcG5UFxrKTAGValzaeDJqRCJNrCASLwNYZSbcKHKTEPgXxlnM140&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft5OHExHDGrePCqy-tYD_6MXmIkhDnJkDCqjVPDghVgVg&oe=69A58F08"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot03.png", "id": "2057311598107878", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_2057311601441211_8310860660269077219_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Goz8XennBSgQ7kNvwEkzWl4&_nc_oc=AdkpKHvqWERYONhRa6-xUMi3yYXtRuhAFuz_JiiZm0RJNLj9n_lRKQ0-EICzsrpcCKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv1QYQxLG8ylIw1MmBC0MgpTbzcC-68-MgSgFVunn89ZQ&oe=69A58E2A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Forefront_Youtube_Thumbnail_2560x1440_v2.png", "id": "1340037183858384", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393432_1340037187191717_4433184722322802065_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1wh7769MJVcQ7kNvwEi5AtC&_nc_oc=AdnWMazTD0hcRabBsaroZdyPm2f-V9r_51c3FMx7LLjWj4W5kv9J-cWUt2dmnXkoKdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsOSQok9TuMV4IdC8Qjp10XzH0oRQ2EFz5jzJFvoWWfyw&oe=69A56DCC"}, "display_name": "Forefront", "keywords": ["Forefront", "fps", "shooter", "military", "action"], "long_description": "# Forefront \u2013 The Next Evolution of VR Warfare\nFrom the creators of **Breachers** and **Hyper Dash**, **Forefront** delivers an **all-out war experience like never before in VR**. Engage in **massive 32-player battles** across a variety of expansive, semi-destructible environments, where strategy, skill, and teamwork decide the outcome.\n\n{1815988855801809}\n\n\ud83d\ude81 **Command land, sea, and air vehicles** \u2013 Pilot helicopters, drive tanks, and storm objectives in humvees and boats.\n\n{659860923053266}\n\n\ud83d\udd2b **Choose your class** \u2013 Play as Assault, Engineer, Medic, or Sniper, each with specialized weapons and gadgets.\n\n{978836180978704}\n\n\ud83d\udd25 **Feel the impact** \u2013 Realistic gunplay, tactical movement, and large-scale combat bring the battlefield to life.\n\n{1416901679278740}\n\n\ud83d\udca5 **Shape the fight** \u2013 Blast through walls, collapse structures, and use destruction to create new paths or deny enemy cover.\n\n{988904792660435}\n\nThe year is **2035**. A powerful energy corporation, O.R.E., has built a private military to defend its **monopoly on Red Orpiment, a rare mineral set to power the world**, while local governments and resistance fighters battle to reclaim control. You are the tip of the spear in the war to control it\u2014**which side will you take?**\n\n\u26a1 **Early Access in 2025 \u2013 Playtests begin this summer!**\n\n\ud83d\udccc **Wishlist now to be the first to fight!**\n\n\ud83d\udd17 **Join our community: ForefrontVR.com/Discord**\n", "short_description": "Forefront is an intense VR shooter featuring 32-player large-scale battles, land, sea, and air vehicles, and immersive, tactical combat. You are the tip of the spear in the war between a global energy giant and resistance forces. Which side will you take?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.triangle-factory.be/forefront-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.triangle-factory.be/forefront-terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Triangle Factory", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.triangle-factory.be/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracki